{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36998","headline":"南园题 · 罗隐","name":"南园题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"搏击路终迷，南园且灌畦。\n敢言逃俗态，自是乐幽栖。\n叶长春松阔，科圆早薤齐。\n雨沾虚槛冷，雪压远山低。\n竹好还成径，桃夭亦有蹊。\n小窗奔野马，闲瓮养醯鸡。\n水石心逾切，烟霄分已暌。\n病怜王猛畚，愚笑隗嚣泥。\n泽国潮平岸，江村柳覆堤。\n到头乘兴是，谁手好提携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}